 they sell?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:24:53Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "just to change things up, i will try to make a slowest-fingers-first question", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:01Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Coffee", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:04Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "coffee", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:05Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Coffee", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:06Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Sell", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:08Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Coffee", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:10Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Coffee", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:13Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "They sold coffee", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:23Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Vats: 40, Kp: 20", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:39Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Faltu Funda First karunga main", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T15:25:45Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Kabhi Kabhi sochta hu itna Lamba question banane ki mehnat karke kya fayda", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "m